#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:5 0e79c639f55b4e84944fb2af08d6acd6
#: 5152950c18f34bbab485c73c1b63de29 904a96f698b246e69c8906cc42d74d37
#: e8677f95d56e427f833841ef8637c342 f918117715564c1088ee0dbe98c4cf61
msgid "Refining Calibration Parameters using a Flight Log"
msgstr "使用飞行日志优化校准参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:7 05c7fa33991643b780693bc6ef4e738e
#: 842eab3dc9b14a18be8a74844c0e6297 a63ad68415ab4a27aed5d192b1c54271
#: d54e9813b1a84d16becdd1e6debe8b3f deb3ebe3571743109d9afdf4fcd1326b
msgid ""
"The compass offsets, scales, diagonals, and even motor compensation can be "
"determined from a flight dataflash log of the vehicle using the web browser-"
"based WebTools MagFit utility. This utility is available `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__."
msgstr ""
"罗盘的偏移量、比例、对角线，甚至电机补偿，均可通过飞行器的飞行数据闪存日志，使用基于浏览器的 WebTools MagFit 工具来确定。该工具可在 "
"`此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/MAGFit/>`__ 获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:9 658b05eabd4149c8abdc2875044ea028
#: b964431b5dab499da9a8f46ac05d2054 bd284528b38c4ae0a123af46caddcf1b
#: d3c13a9b63a544ddb00002d5c41a4b64 f71d69dff8cd4cd3bf0d88791cf16e93
msgid ""
"Using a flight log, the utility uses the GPS location, the vehicle attitude,"
" and the World Magnetic Model database to compare the logged magnetic field "
"components from the vehicle compass and compare the x/y/z values to that "
"expected which are graphed. It also will run a calibration routine to "
"correct the Ardupilot compass parameter values to improve the compass "
"performance. Offsets (OFS), diagonals(DIA), ellipticals(ODI), motor current "
"compensation, and scale parameters can be corrected."
msgstr ""
"利用飞行日志，该工具使用 GPS 位置、飞行器姿态和世界磁力模型数据库，将飞行器罗盘记录的磁场分量与预期值进行对比，并以图形展示 x/y/z "
"分量。它还会运行校准例程以修正 ArduPilot "
"罗盘参数值，提升罗盘性能。可修正的内容包括偏移量（OFS）、对角线（DIA）、椭圆形（ODI）、电机电流补偿及比例参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:12 0618a3fb7b7841d3a024c4842ab82858
#: 63ba0765a2a44365a1de8c11b15a6081 710f2c57f9e14ae6a4556d0ebc67395c
#: c91651e539474935a41d4e877f629945 df07a63aeb4d4563add0c1adfbb859e5
msgid "It can detect incorrect orientation, also."
msgstr "它还能检测方向设置是否有误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:15 3dacc6ea518a4f85903ff02c2b40ed52
#: 7d8f55abd0404bfcbbff07095bb4865d 8b3d80842edd4156bf23cd4f559be1cd
#: c1b193b2b33a49ca88d0b32e1c61f093 d187e072f509495c86b783c9cbb123be
msgid "Using WebTools MagFit"
msgstr "使用 WebTools MagFit"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:16 2d7cca9b0a73498aabbebe5dace721c5
#: 49636112133f49b3883b3a05e495170c 5d7e9b999e7c46c1b04d6b473dcee419
#: 850f14345f484db4acb60ff49df73205 acd80dd84785447a90b51864f364c64a
msgid "load flight log"
msgstr "加载飞行日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:17 366b53cda297426a911e62904dfcdb85
#: 68ead19462014eee8e8b91163ce77dfb c4439199ba994d8dba432e598614728c
#: e1bf9fa2c91544e1a4f5af1994a5c22c f0f9fa85c05c4844a033a110b2c3a597
msgid ""
"select relevant portion of log to analyze (eliminate on the ground portions)"
msgstr "选择要分析的日志相关部分（排除地面部分）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:18 18cd6d2827994fbeae45f886ebbbb7ef
#: 55fe17b706e944d2882406606b590d8e 8d52f9f766c74bef92c9d712136e6482
#: b9a7024d158d406b86c887536ae3fdd8 d46df2c8427b460abf0ff844e063b7a1
msgid ""
"select which parameters to optimize( unless there is significant motor "
"current interference or large nearby ferro-magnetic objects like batteries "
"to the compass, offset optimization  will usually be sufficient)"
msgstr "选择要优化的参数（除非存在显著的电机电流干扰或电池等大型铁磁体对罗盘的较强干扰，通常偏移量优化就足够了）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:19 39d05e67538a42a68ad1bbda8b480540
#: cedbbdf7cfb6444fb61461e5c71c86ff d5196259131b404591384719c79f219a
#: da2f7bda2c3f4a8c844c8de478628e97 dbf21eeb37a441f6870790e0ed5b8a4c
msgid ""
"check if the reduction in heading deviation is acceptable with the new param"
" values(usually <10deg is okay)"
msgstr "检查使用新参数值后航向偏差的减少是否可接受（通常 <10 度即可）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:20 451016bf16e044cd8d5df742898fa47b
#: 48ec43e26e1d4984a49534a32b7c7f4f 707b003f22284a9cba65e1ee7c8fdc9a
#: 7a62e5e067d0428a85ba4911611a955d b8c4ddc4b7e04ceb892bf90f9b123c91
msgid "save the new values to a file and load into the autopilot."
msgstr "将新值保存到文件并加载到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:22 411eb9aa234c43a5aec14743236d97d9
#: 61607ad5eed344e2844c6e60db69029e e785adffe84a4a99a4323eb7e5380e25
#: f1d56d4f5c77453d871ce14856b87bea f82c5d8729fb4400a31354d48a15fcac
msgid "Here is a video explaining the utility's options and use:"
msgstr "以下视频介绍了该工具的选项和使用方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:28 5a27b9650d304b06932c987e43aac8b5
#: 962fa8665e7a4f7abab490c05ab607b2 b427ca618aa14caca22834eb30ae71bc
#: ce49acece1424480a9b17e7f5cc27843 f3b7b757c6b24757a45f15e7d4898499
msgid "Using MAVExplorer's integrated Magfit utility"
msgstr "使用 MAVExplorer 集成的 Magfit 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:30 1c29820177c647d2a00b8de3be9f08f2
#: 26465157fc7a4357af91a24b68672b98 3ad27e54960b487baa0389791291fd4a
#: 435f356ea7f546bf8e32c44ba69a282f f41860975a8c4334a06a13a68924bc83
msgid ""
"Now MAVExplorer has a Tools menu which includes this utility and allows it "
"to be applied to any portion of the log by simply opening any Graph and "
"zooming (magnifying glass icon) to the area to be analyzed. If no graph is "
"opened, and area selected, then the entire log will be used."
msgstr ""
"MAVExplorer "
"的工具菜单现已包含此工具，只需打开任意图表并缩放（放大镜图标）到要分析的区域即可应用。如果未打开图表也未选择区域，则使用整个日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:32 05f66427ddbf4382a25e9d1e7f7ad5e0
#: 1af7f02aa1a24aaa9c8e5559d7b60ea0 67c5bcd8fc5a4cbca71fd64b9affe610
#: bcf66d4acc714c59a836523de1a71b28 cf544cf7c121478aa87afe77fbfa4591
msgid "Below is a video of the process."
msgstr "以下是操作过程的视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:34 11376a2ddc904bc989cee43e34d5ce1d
#: 28bfe67579bf441583e54ecf4826f6cd 37d1067bc81d455e84a84fb287cbaf93
#: 458c7549e3b3474dae8a726d8c5702dc 582c18d145654e39a9220fceba354df8
msgid ""
"selecting CMOT No Change box, will calculate the CMOT correction values, but"
" not apply them to the corrected graph."
msgstr "勾选「CMOT No Change」框，将计算 CMOT 校正值，但不将其应用到修正后的图表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:40 ad03c15746a946c4a9239e274c60d040
#: cb33a2091d064e499294859f552ade4a cf4ce58f2acc4fc6bfee475af6685c27
#: e64e6b935328484080b8b1b0692b874c ebcb876193c445979cc99365a1b80581
msgid "Hints and Tips"
msgstr "提示与技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:42 3a5775094af4432586fbe84158531b0b
#: 6f977fcc2c4e409f93a535cab7f348c6 d8aa8808c98445c59b9ea80c05176dca
#: dc0fc35592814cbe838b70d5f6060277 fbb60daf16b74df3a6ee212294e4a01f
msgid ""
"Be sure you have several complete turns during the flight and at least a few"
" minutes of log."
msgstr "确保飞行过程中有数次完整圈和至少几分钟的日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:43 03aa0f7ca9124320a031e9bc49010edb
#: 08852005ed644ea59d74326fac904608 5eac401bb3de496d83d6581bb5b99029
#: 651405aed30c4c8c878d90c2637033ef ab23670d2aa34a42ae896cb7dc985fba
msgid ""
"Be sure you put conditions on the analysis so you do not include data while "
"on the ground or being carried."
msgstr "确保为分析设置条件，不包含在地面或被携带时的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:44 2b54c5f915e446599b6c92c0656cdaba
#: 39fdbfa57b744392a8b3724a4bc856dc 4a70c2cd091545ff97136dea458930bf
#: fa36279f65024b9ca82158cca4802cd3 fadcd87389c64cac9d8f786fa28d36ad
msgid ""
"Be sure you have already calibrated the compasses prior to the flight. You "
"can use the tool on very poorly calibrated compasses, but that could be a "
"flight hazard (unless its a plane or vehicle not dependent on compass)."
msgstr "确保飞行前已校准罗盘。可以对校准极差的罗盘使用该工具，但这可能带来飞行风险（除非是不依赖罗盘的固定翼或其他飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:45 6bf677de227f404ea3aa40ef364e1ebb
#: 7cf9e0506067404abd71dcfea1e8c82e a668d37e562344cdb6cd4c79d46d99b3
#: b85f8c0d614a419a8ee0b39b2ebbc59d c44232e81d1b43f7b75b67704f3b83ef
msgid ""
"If you have large COMPASS_MOT values indicating strong motor/battery system "
"interference, be sure that none of those components can shift in flight, "
"resulting in invalidating the compass motor interference corrections you "
"entered."
msgstr "如果 COMPASS_MOT 值较大，说明电机/电池系统干扰较强，须确保这些部件在飞行中不会移位，否则会使您输入的罗盘电机干扰补偿值失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-magfit.rst:46 159ab1dad5214c76a3bd880793ac08fb
#: 58a27bad724c4efbbb7b6940a1c53238 9c90d512586e448e83f4c617998a61c5
#: b53dd991438345408f93d4008866b5c4 b6797d17c05940dd872897bea5886be3
msgid ""
"The EKF's sole purpose is to filter out sensor inaccuracies and system "
"disturbances. If the ATT yaw change is very large( > 20 degrees), this means"
" that something else is possibly very wrong in the other sensors, or vehicle"
" setup, and needs to be investigated before using the new compass "
"calibration parameter values."
msgstr ""
"EKF 的唯一目的是过滤传感器误差和系统扰动。如果 ATT 偏航变化非常大（>20 "
"度），说明其他传感器或飞行器设置可能存在严重问题，须在使用新罗盘校准参数值之前进行排查。"
